WEBVTT

00:16:56.662 --> 00:17:00.496
then you only last until there's another
more dominant individual who's going

00:17:00.496 --> 00:17:01.496
to overpower you.

00:17:01.954 --> 00:17:05.746
Yes. And clever, clever coalition.

00:17:05.746 --> 00:17:10.121
I mean, coalitions play a very
major part in chimp society.

00:17:10.121 --> 00:17:11.496
Really important part.

00:17:12.496 --> 00:17:15.704
Well, I think that's another piece of the
puzzle that I was wondering about,

00:17:15.704 --> 00:17:21.246
is it seems that if if dominance is the
strategy to gain power or status,

00:17:21.871 --> 00:17:24.746
then you're essentially creating

00:17:24.746 --> 00:17:29.954
a culture in which everybody's position
is is determined by strength.